cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenMacroState in research, cite the software release and the
  individual replay cases, datasets, and upstream sources you relied on.
title: OpenMacroState
type: software
abstract: >-
  An auditable, point-in-time operating system for global macro research,
  historical replay, evidence provenance, mechanism analysis, and prediction
  evaluation.
authors:
  - name: OpenMacroState Contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/alainresearch/openmacrostate
url: https://github.com/alainresearch/openmacrostate
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - macroeconomics
  - point-in-time data
  - reproducible research
  - provenance
  - historical replay
  - economic data
